    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Begin w2-5 rescue breaths b4 starting strd CPR compressions. Cont strd CPR after initial rescue breaths. Apply hypothermia protocols if submersion occurred in cold H2O. "
     }
    ]
   },
   {
